# What must never be published
# ============================================================================
# This repository is served publicly by GitHub Pages. Everything committed to
# it is downloadable by anyone, so the rule here is an allow-list in spirit:
# only the files the website actually serves belong in it.

# The ebooks are the PRODUCT, so the PDFs stay out. Their SOURCE does not:
# on 26 Sep a script deleted 600 lines of ebooks/build.mjs and there was no
# committed copy to restore from, because this rule covered the whole folder.
# It cost most of a day to reconstruct from session transcripts.
#
# So: ignore the output, track everything that produces it.
ebooks/*
!ebooks/*.mjs
!ebooks/*.json
ebooks/*.pdf

# Instagram source material and working images — not part of the website.
photos/
posts/
build/
content/

# Build tooling is source too, and for the same reason. The notes stay local.
!tools/
tools/*.log
PROJECT.md
POSTING-SCHEDULE.md
BETA-OUTREACH.md

# Layout preview with placeholder review text. It carries a noindex tag, but
# the safest place for a page of fake-looking quotes is off the internet.
_preview-reviews.html

# Local junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Internal architecture notes and unit tests — no reason to serve them.
site/INTEGRATION.md
site/calc.test.js
GO-LIVE.md
brand/_preview/
